  <item>
    <title>串台小明拆台｜2023爱丁堡，我们看到了什么？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65178e4b09d40ceb8bd98763</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65178e4b09d40ceb8bd98763</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 29 Sep 2023 08:21:14 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目和【小明拆台Ming Strike】共同完成</span></p><p><span>小明拆台是几位住在英国搞表演的小明，聚焦世界各地表演和艺术界事件和现象，讨论她们作为艺术家的创作和观察</span><br><br></p><p><span>月不落看戏嘉宾：</span></p><p><span>- 【看戏睡觉不睡觉】虾米</span></p><p><span>- 【肆体不勤】三疯</span></p><br><p><span>小明拆台嘉宾</span></p><p><span>- 曾不容，迁徙于伦敦和北京，关注和书写当代艺术中的表演，偶尔友情出演</span></p><p><span>- Mengting， 当代表演研究与创作者，现居伦敦</span></p><br><p><span>本期剪辑是【小明拆台Ming Strike】的Flo</span></p><br><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="100">01:40</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="340">05:40</a> 住在伦敦也去不起的爱丁堡</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="341">05:41</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1075">17:55</a> 主单元选目质量完败阿维尼翁的爱丁堡</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1076">17:56</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1380">23:00</a> 殷切期待有利文化政策的不列颠</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1386">23:06</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1790">29:50</a> 从缘起到争议都跟阿维尼翁不约而同的爱丁堡</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1791">29:51</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2320">38:40</a> 说fringe戏：Funeral, alone together</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2321">38:41</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3284">54:44</a> 说fringe戏：Oak Tree, 一切只发生在脑中</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3285">54:45</a> - 结尾   说fringe戏：Help, I think I'm a nationalist和民族主义的思考</span></p><br><p><span>本期节目的图文索引：</span></p><p><span><a data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/xw_SfAqQYDgCrnf4Ktj1kA" href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/xw_SfAqQYDgCrnf4Ktj1kA">mp.weixin.qq.com</a></span></p>]]></description>
